# Theme

## Source of truth
- Design tokens: `src/theme/themes.ts` (`COLORS`, `FONTS`, `SPACING`, `RADII`, `SHADOWS`).
- `src/constants/theme.ts` re-exports for backward compat.
- `tailwind.config.js` must mirror token names (`bg`, `gold`, `t-1`, etc.).

## NativeWind v4
- Entry: `global.css` imported in `App.tsx` or `index.ts`.
- Metro: `metro.config.js` wraps with NativeWind.
- Components use Tailwind classes, not raw hex.

## Adding a token
1. Add to `src/theme/themes.ts`
2. Extend `tailwind.config.js` `theme.extend`
3. Use as `className` in UI — never duplicate hex in components

## Shadows exception
Shadows stay in `StyleSheet` using `SHADOWS` from theme — NativeWind shadow support is limited on Android.
